        "text_RgjiyF": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Kinetika Bloco, founded in 2000, is a youth music charity that empowers young people from South London through inclusive creative activities in music and dance. They provide a safe, inspiring space where youth aged 8-25 can grow, connect, and realise their potential.<br/><br/>Through workshops, after-school clubs, leadership programs, and performances, they offer a vibrant and inclusive pathway for young people to learn, express themselves, and explore the Creative Industries. <br/><br/>A unique strength of Kinetika Bloco is their community—75% of their Leadership Team are alumni who return to mentor the next generation. This ongoing cycle of giving back highlights the deep impact Kinetika Bloco has on its members and showcases the power of unity.<br/><br/></p>"
          }
        }
